+# Unreleased
+
+## Features
+
+- Add `--sort` option to sort search results by one or more fields, with support for reverse order, directory/file grouping, natural order, case sensitivity, missing-value handling, and deterministic random sorting via `--sort-seed`.
+
 # 10.4.2
 
 ## Bugfixes
